{
  "scope": "Controlled PAC execution of self-contained Darwin scalar authenticated calls: signed/unsigned 8/16/32-bit integers, 64-bit integers and pointers, f32/f64, exhausted GP/FP registers, packed fixed spills and Darwin stack variadics, IA/IB, zero/dynamic discriminator and raw controls. Actual Mach-O text is copied without code generation or instruction changes. Does not qualify aggregates/HFAs, authenticated storage, whole images, native Apple execution, signed exception unwinding or exact fault PC/ESR.",
